ltést, nyisd meg közvetlenül:<!-- --> <a href=\"/autofit-ai.zip\" download=\"\" class=\"text-brand-400 underline underline-offset-2\">/<!-- -->autofit-ai.zip</a></p></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"card p-5\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-tree h-4 w-4 text-brand-400\"><path d=\"M20 10a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V6a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2.5a1 1 0 0 1-.8-.4l-.9-1.2A1 1 0 0 0 15 3h-2a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M20 21a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2.9a1 1 0 0 1-.88-.55l-.42-.85a1 1 0 0 0-.92-.6H13a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M3 5a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3\"></path></svg>A csomag tartalma</h2><ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-graphite-300\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>src/ – a teljes forráskód (Next.js App Router oldalak + komponensek)</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>src/lib/catalog/ + src/lib/supabase/ – katalógus-szolgáltató és Supabase adatréteg</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>src/app/api/ – szerveroldali API route-ok (felhasználói adatok + admin)</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>public/parts/ – 34 saját SVG alkatrészillusztráció (offline elérhető)</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>scripts/ – SVG generátor, ZIP csomagoló és Supabase-ellenőrző segédszkriptek</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>package.json + package-lock.json</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>tailwind.config.ts, tsconfig.json</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>next.config.mjs, postcss.config.mjs</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>README.md – futtatási útmutató</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>AGENTS.md – fejlesztői jegyzetek</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>.env.example – Supabase környezeti változók mintája (opcionális)</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>.gitignore</li></ul></div><div class=\"card p-5\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal h-4 w-4 text-brand-400\"><polyline points=\"4 17 10 11 4 5\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"19\" y2=\"19\"></line></svg>Futtatás</h2><pre class=\"mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-ink-700 bg-ink-950 p-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-graphite-200\">unzip autofit-ai.zip\ncd autofit-ai\nnpm install\nnpm run dev</pre><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-graphite-500\">→ http://localhost:3000</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 card p-5\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-white\">Nincs a csomagban</h2><ul class=\"mt-3 grid gap-1.5 text-sm text-graphite-400 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-graphite-600\"></span>node_modules/ – npm install pótolja</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-graphite-600\"></span>.next/ – npm run build pótolja</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-graphite-600\"></span>.git/ – verziókezelési előzmények</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-graphite-600\"></span>*.tsbuildinfo – gyorsítótár</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-brand-500/25 bg-brand-500/[0.07] px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-300\">i</span><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-brand-100/90 sm:text-sm\">A letöltött projekt a valós Supabase adatbázisra épül: a jármű- és alkatrészadatok, valamint a felhasználói mentések (garázs, kedvencek, ellenőrzések) az adatbázisban tárolódnak. A kapcsolatot a .env.example alapján kell beállítani (külső AI nélkül).</p></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-20 border-t border-ink-800 bg-ink-950\"><div class=\"container-page py-14\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(3,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2.5\" aria-label=\"AutoFit AI – főoldal\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"relative grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-brand-700 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\"><path d=\"M4 15.5 5.6 9.2A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 7.93 7.5h8.14a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 2.33 1.7L20 15.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M3.2 15.5h17.6v2.6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-.8H6.8v.8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4.2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.6Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"7.4\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle><circle cx=\"16.6\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circl